general
  core.abort    Abort    Ends the workflow as failed
  core.dummy    Dummy    Does nothing; collects branches into one point
  core.log      Log      Writes a message to the run log
  core.start    Start    Entry point of the workflow
  core.success  Success  Ends the workflow successfully
  core.wait     Wait     Waits for a given time
files
  file.copy    Copy Files     Copies files or folders; output: the copied files
  file.delete  Delete Files   Deletes files or folders; output: the deleted paths
  file.exists  File Exists    Checks whether files or folders exist; output: the matching paths
  file.list    List Files     Lists the files of a folder; output: path, name, size, modified and folder of each entry
  file.mkdir   Create Folder  Creates a folder with its parent folders; output: the path
  file.move    Move Files     Moves files or folders; output: the new paths
  file.wait    Wait for File  Waits until files exist; output: the matching paths
